{
  "id": "Halo Combat Evolved Action Book",
  "name": "Halo: Combat Evolved Action Book",
  "description": "What the campaign's characters can do when spoken to, as OpenCE's chasm bridge does it: orders to the speaker's squad (follow, hold, advance, charge, board or leave a vehicle), handing over a weapon, and turning on the player or standing down.",
